"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n是的，这的确是一场漂亮的胜仗。\n即使是强大的东吴水军，\n恐怕一时也难以恢复元气了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n主公，不可错过这个大好良机，\n一鼓作气消灭东吴吧。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,0,2]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n主公，屬下已經與夏侯惇將軍一同\n去調查那個祭壇了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。\n調查結果如何？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n主公！我們在那裡發現了本該已死的\n張家兄弟。但是他們現在卻莫名地消失\n不見，實在是太可疑了！"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":5313,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[790]]},"end":124,"end_off":5416},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n除此以外，我們還看到了復活的張角\n操控木人來對付我們，簡直讓人難以\n置信。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,256]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n什麼！？此話當真？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n確鑿無疑！夏侯惇將軍也看見了。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n就是說呀！但是現在那裡的一切都\n已經毀了，我還不禁懷疑我是在作夢呢。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,6,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n是啊。莫不是因為我親眼所見，\n我也覺得難以置信呢。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n死者居然能夠重生？\n天底下真有如此神奇之事？"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n也罷，如今争论不休也无济于事。\n此时应该全心对付吴军才是。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n是。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n文若，吴军现在何处？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n已经撤退至建业附近的濡须口。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n濡须口……在建业的附近是吧？\n那么吴军必然会奋力死战。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n不过孟德，\n我们也不能因此驻足不前啊。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。\n好吧，前往濡须口！\n我们要彻底打垮吴军！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,0,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,3]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":6346,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[794],[]]},"end":171,"end_off":6417},{"op":111,"name":"lose_item","args":[116]},{"op":111,"name":"lose_item","args":[116]},{"op":105,"name":"popup","args":["本關可使用獨角獸。"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[116,0,0,65535]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,15,19,0,0,0,0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,15,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,15,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units",