e":"玩家切换","body_off":8275,"body_end":8421,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[19]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n（為何那些死去的黃巾賊會復活呢？\n真令人放心不下……）\n&司马懿\n（也罢，此事暂且搁置一旁吧。\n必须集中精力应付这场战斗。）"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":8421,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8446,"body_end":8518,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[23]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n刚才细作传来军情，\n东吴营中不见周瑜和陆逊踪影。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":8518,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8543,"body_end":8620,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n不能给吴军有时间准备，\n一鼓作气进攻吧。\n&曹操\n嗯。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":8620,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8645,"body_end":8707,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[3]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n关某无碍于水战或陆战。\n只求全力杀敌。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":8707,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8732,"body_end":9137,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[15]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,3,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n对了许褚，诗作好了吗？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n唉？\n&夏侯惇\n什么唉啊、哦的。\n孟德应该教你不少了吧？\n到底作了哪些啦？\n&许褚\n……我已经放弃了。\n&夏侯惇\n放弃？为什么嘛？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[15,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n理由……我不想说。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n噢，原来是这样……\n反正我大概也猜得到。\n&许褚\n哼，我才不会放在心上呢。\n反正我生来就是块打仗的料。\n&曹操\n唷唷唷……"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]}]}